## 2. 🛡️ SOC Analyst (Linux Fundamentals & Log Analysis)

### Core Concepts Covered
- **Linux Directory Architecture:**
  - `/etc`: System configuration files.
  - `/var/log`: System event logs (essential for threat investigation).
- **File Permissions & Ownership:**
  - Read (`r`), Write (`w`), Execute (`x`) numerical permissions (`chmod 755`).
- **Log Inspection Commands:**
  - `head` / `tail`: Inspect top or bottom lines of log files.
  - `grep`: Search for specific keywords or IP addresses in terminal outputs.

### Hands-On Lab Work Completed
